{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel, Stream and Share It!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single player and co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with your friend in local or online co-op! Work together to cause chaos and stream your wild adventures while triveling the world! It\u2019s more fun when you\u2019re breaking things <i>together</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole social network is inside of the game and you're going to be a member of this social network inside the game.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Minigames!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/bbc308be3fdf8ef0d2e5502b535f3af1.poster.avif?t=1755648819\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/bbc308be3fdf8ef0d2e5502b535f3af1.webm?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/bbc308be3fdf8ef0d2e5502b535f3af1.mp4?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll visit dozens of location and each one of them has its own minigame:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a casino you can gamble;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a hospital you can\u00a0perform surgery;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a restaurant you can cook.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own unique character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/5c99a2fa60b21a67c61cd816d3e1532f.poster.avif?t=1755648819\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/5c99a2fa60b21a67c61cd816d3e1532f.webm?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/5c99a2fa60b21a67c61cd816d3e1532f.mp4?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the game is unique and you will create your own! Customise your character however you like. There are hundreds of cosmetic items available that you either get for free or from achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced AI.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/cd1b57df3e4c357385ccc28b25fbce6b.poster.avif?t=1755648819\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/cd1b57df3e4c357385ccc28b25fbce6b.webm?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/cd1b57df3e4c357385ccc28b25fbce6b.mp4?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC leads their own life, offering roleplay opportunities, surprising interactions, and multiple narrative paths. Every NPC has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own personality (affects behavior and dialogues with them);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style (currently only Clothes);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG skills and attributes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/16a4eb5539a3b29ca29172acd0071132.poster.avif?t=1755648819\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/16a4eb5539a3b29ca29172acd0071132.webm?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/16a4eb5539a3b29ca29172acd0071132.mp4?t=1755648819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347830?t=1755648819","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347830?t=1755648819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/9b5f310f440adbb2d2be5c431880dbd48996f824/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755648819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/9b5f310f440adbb2d2be5c431880dbd48996f824/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755648819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><st